      "id": "claim_5315d490aedc40bda9663074f0149386",
      "statement": "The shared kubernetes/components/volsync component bundles claim.yaml (PVC ${APP} seeded via dataSourceRef from ReplicationDestination volsync-dst-${APP}) and minio.yaml (ExternalSecret ${APP}-volsync-secret for the MinIO restic repo s3:http://192.168.50.220:9010/volsync/dev/${APP}, a 6-hourly ReplicationSource ${APP}, and a manual restore-once ReplicationDestination volsync-dst-${APP}), all parameterized by substitutes such as APP, VOLSYNC_CAPACITY, VOLSYNC_ACCESSMODES, VOLSYNC_STORAGECLASS, VOLSYNC_CACHE_CAPACITY, VOLSYNC_COPYMETHOD, and APP_UID/APP_GID.",
