      "statement": "Apps adopt shared VolSync by adding ../../../../components/volsync to components: in their ks.yaml and setting substitutes (e.g. openclaw sets APP, VOLSYNC_CAPACITY: 20Gi, VOLSYNC_CACHE_CAPACITY: 10Gi); migrated apps remove app-local pvc.yaml and volsync.yaml.",
